650                                                       |
The laser system is not in operating mode, even though it
has been activated, it means that the light beam is not
free or that the laser system is not ready to measure.
651                                                       |
The beam shutter of the laser system is not closed and
protected from pollution, even though it has been 
de-activated.
652                                                       |
The measuring block cannot be executed because the position
of the tool and the laser beam is not correct, or because
the measuring signal is already high active at the start
moment.
653                                                       |
The scattering of single measuring values of a measuring
series exceeds the allowed tolerance Q362.
654                                                       |
The parameter approach side radial axis (line 20) or
the approach side length axis (line 21) in the file 
BLUM_000.TAB is not correctly defined.
655                                                       |
The search algorithm to determine the laser beam middle
for cycle 582 was interrupted without trigger point.
The change of the trigger point position since the last
calibration/temp. compensation is larger than 1mm.
656                                                       |
No trigger signal has been detected during the last meas.
block. The cycle has been aborted due to this error.
657                                                       |
There is no tool loaded in the spindle or the tool number
is invalid.
658                                                       |
The length or radius values preset in the file TOOL.T or
measured in the cycle are out of the allowed tool dimension
limits defined in the file BLUM_000.TAB (line 60,61,62,63).
659                                                       |
The chosen parameter values for measuring mode Q350 demand
a Blum laser system with NT functions. The actual system
has no NT possibilities, the function cannot be executed.
660                                                       |
The measured values L and/or R in the length axis or in the
radial axis exceeds the max. allowed tolerance LTOL or RTOL.
661                                                       |
The parameter starting angle Q363, final angle Q364, edge
radius R2, scanning stroke Q353 or axial offset LOFFS exceed
together the allowed max. depth.There is a risk of
collision, because the tool tip moves too deep into the
laser beam. (Limitation for MICRO/NANO system is necessary)
662                                                       |
In the last TOOL CALL command the tool axis was not defined
or the given tool axis doesn't agree with the parameter
length axis in the file BLUM_000.TAB (line 7).
663                                                       |
The number of cutting edges for the actual tool is preset
in the tool memory with CUT=0. The spindle rotation speed
for the single cutting edge control can't be calculated
correctly.
664                                                       |
One of the measuring parameter (LTOL,RTOL,LOFFS,ROFFS,
CUT, LBREAK,RBREAK) in the table TOOL.T is preset to a not
valid value.
665                                                       |
One or several call parameters (Q350 - Q368) is/are
assigned with a critical or faulty value.
666                                                       |
The parameter table PLC:\BLUM\BLUM_0**.TAB or
PLC:\BLUM\PICO_0**.TAB could not be found or
parameter values in the file are faulty.
667                                                       |
During evaluation of the measuring data an irreparable
error was realized, e.g. division by zero.
668                                                       |
The operating speed or check speed for the single cutting
edge control was not achieved in a preset period or is
greater than the at the last TOOL CALL command defined
max. admissible spindle speed. The cutting edge control
cannot be effected correctly.
669                                                       |
The trigger position returned from the control deviates
more than 20mm from the actual axis position
!! Risk of collision!!
